{
    "title": "Vivino: Buy the Right Wine",
    "description": "With 65 million users, Vivino is the world\u2019s largest wine app and your one-stop shop for ratings, recommendations, food pairings, learning, and cellar management alongside the most exciting range of wines you'd ever want to drink.\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re an expert or a beginner, Vivino has everything you need to go from scanning to sipping, all in one place.\u00a0\r\n\r\nGet essential info fast\r\n\r\nScan labels and wine lists, or search names, to instantly get important details including unbiased ratings, tasting notes, and even food pairings.\r\n\r\nChoose with confidence\r\n\r\nGet a \u2018Match for You\u2019 score for every wine and insights into why we think you\u2019ll like or dislike it.\u00a0\r\n\r\nTrack your tastes\r\n\r\nRate and review wines to record what you love (or don\u2019t). Keep your Taste Profile updated to discover what to drink next and how you rank against the Vivino community.\r\n\r\nBuy the world\u2019s most-loved wines\r\n\r\nUsing community data we source and sell the world's most-loved wines. We\u2019ll even recommend bottles based on your ratings and preferences \u2013 all delivered directly to your door.\r\n\r\nManage your collection\u00a0\r\n\r\nUse our Cellar management feature to sort and organize your collection by grape, style, food pairing, and even drinking window.\u00a0\r\n\r\nInteractive wine courses\r\n\r\nUse Vivino\u2019s \u2018Wine Adventure\u2019 to get a deeper knowledge of regions, grapes, food pairing, and more. Or access Vivino\u2019s library of wine regions and styles to learn more whenever you like\r\n\r\nConnect with the community\r\n\r\nAdd friends, family, and expert community members to share your love of wine and get recommendations from trusted sources beyond the critics.\u00a0\r\n\r\nVivino includes both a free version and a subscription version with premium features.\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy: https://www.vivino.com/privacy\r\nTerms of use: https://www.vivino.com/terms\r\n\r\nPlease note that we are not able to reply to comments or questions left in App Store reviews. If you have any support-related inquiries or need assistance, please contact support@vivino.com\r\n\r\nSTATS AT A GLANCE\r\n\u2022 65 million app downloads and climbing\r\n\u2022 16 million wines and counting from 245,000+ wineries\r\n\u2022 Millions of unbiased ratings and reviews\r\n\u2022 Hundreds of thousands of wines available for purchase in 18 markets worldwide\"",
    "descriptionHTML": "With 65 million users, Vivino is the world\u2019s largest wine app and your one-stop shop for ratings, recommendations, food pairings, learning, and cellar management alongside the most exciting range of wines you&#39;d ever want to drink.<br><br>Whether you\u2019re an expert or a beginner, Vivino has everything you need to go from scanning to sipping, all in one place.\u00a0<br><br>Get essential info fast<br><br>Scan labels and wine lists, or search names, to instantly get important details including unbiased ratings, tasting notes, and even food pairings.<br><br>Choose with confidence<br><br>Get a \u2018Match for You\u2019 score for every wine and insights into why we think you\u2019ll like or dislike it.\u00a0<br><br>Track your tastes<br><br>Rate and review wines to record what you love (or don\u2019t). Keep your Taste Profile updated to discover what to drink next and how you rank against the Vivino community.<br><br>Buy the world\u2019s most-loved wines<br><br>Using community data we source and sell the world&#39;s most-loved wines. We\u2019ll even recommend bottles based on your ratings and preferences \u2013 all delivered directly to your door.<br><br>Manage your collection\u00a0<br><br>Use our Cellar management feature to sort and organize your collection by grape, style, food pairing, and even drinking window.\u00a0<br><br>Interactive wine courses<br><br>Use Vivino\u2019s \u2018Wine Adventure\u2019 to get a deeper knowledge of regions, grapes, food pairing, and more. Or access Vivino\u2019s library of wine regions and styles to learn more whenever you like<br><br>Connect with the community<br><br>Add friends, family, and expert community members to share your love of wine and get recommendations from trusted sources beyond the critics.\u00a0<br><br>Vivino includes both a free version and a subscription version with premium features.<br><br>Privacy policy: https://www.vivino.com/privacy<br>Terms of use: https://www.vivino.com/terms<br